INTERPRETATION: mod-25 clears a family => it is LOOSE (M>=2/25), not in gap. If the ONLY
non-cleared families are already loose or =AP (never in gap), then mod-25 EXTENDS to d=1,d=2
=> kps's GREEN gate covers them too, and (C) at N=12 is essentially the mod-25 covering fact.
